  "details": "I think VRC should adopt a system where, if someone is reported for saying something against ToS, a recording of the reported persons audio from the past 5 minutes automatically gets sent to the mod team attached to the ticket. That or something similar where it also records video on top of the audio.\n\nIt'd make getting rid of adults being inappropriate towards minors, people spamming slurs, and ban evaders a lot easier so long as the person is immediately reported after the offence.\n\nFortnite does the same thing with their voice chat moderation system and it works really well.",
